{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Astro Out",
    "steam_appid": 3758420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/9a6e06344e549e557f3cbfaef61c5e83.poster.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/9a6e06344e549e557f3cbfaef61c5e83.webm?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astro Out</i> is a challenging precision platformer where you\u2019ll need skill, patience, and determination to survive a planet that seems to defy logic. Explore a mysterious world while trying to escape, uncover what is causing all those strange events and the truth behind your crash into the planet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/fe20a3ccf1f1819a0e70e1386f5d4b7e.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=100 /></span>As you explore this strange world, you\u2019ll gradually gain access to new\u00a0upgrades that enhance how you traverse the environment. Each one expands your ability to reach new areas, attempt harder challenges, or recover from previously unforgiving mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/333414e06054f9b25e7fd5a1cb320971.poster.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/333414e06054f9b25e7fd5a1cb320971.webm?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/333414e06054f9b25e7fd5a1cb320971.mp4?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/04766b648bccfaa6272e18bb3935d4a8.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump matters.<br>There are <strong>no checkpoints</strong>,  <strong>no enemies</strong> to defeat, <strong>no weapons</strong> to master, only the environment itself, and your ability to navigate it, one misstep, and you're falling way back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/1530606c10bd1b39989c85b9b315f4b3.poster.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/1530606c10bd1b39989c85b9b315f4b3.webm?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/1530606c10bd1b39989c85b9b315f4b3.mp4?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/820897df6d25aa7ad723d0c92fbebf9c.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were trying to investigate strange signals coming from an uncharted planet. But as you approach, a black, shapeless goo takes control of your ship leading you to crash into the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you\u2019re stranded in a surreal world where the laws of nature seem broken. Objects float in mid-air. Portals appear and vanish without warning, something is clearly very wrong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is this place?<br>What caused the signals?<br>Why is reality falling apart and how do you get out? <br>Is it all real or are you just losing your mind? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/c0283b49de507c8b765970dfdd29e459.poster.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/c0283b49de507c8b765970dfdd29e459.webm?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/c0283b49de507c8b765970dfdd29e459.mp4?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/9a6e06344e549e557f3cbfaef61c5e83.poster.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/9a6e06344e549e557f3cbfaef61c5e83.webm?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astro Out</i> is a challenging precision platformer where you\u2019ll need skill, patience, and determination to survive a planet that seems to defy logic. Explore a mysterious world while trying to escape, uncover what is causing all those strange events and the truth behind your crash into the planet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/fe20a3ccf1f1819a0e70e1386f5d4b7e.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=100 /></span>As you explore this strange world, you\u2019ll gradually gain access to new\u00a0upgrades that enhance how you traverse the environment. Each one expands your ability to reach new areas, attempt harder challenges, or recover from previously unforgiving mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/333414e06054f9b25e7fd5a1cb320971.poster.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/333414e06054f9b25e7fd5a1cb320971.webm?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/333414e06054f9b25e7fd5a1cb320971.mp4?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/04766b648bccfaa6272e18bb3935d4a8.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump matters.<br>There are <strong>no checkpoints</strong>,  <strong>no enemies</strong> to defeat, <strong>no weapons</strong> to master, only the environment itself, and your ability to navigate it, one misstep, and you're falling way back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/1530606c10bd1b39989c85b9b315f4b3.poster.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/1530606c10bd1b39989c85b9b315f4b3.webm?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/1530606c10bd1b39989c85b9b315f4b3.mp4?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/820897df6d25aa7ad723d0c92fbebf9c.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were trying to investigate strange signals coming from an uncharted planet. But as you approach, a black, shapeless goo takes control of your ship leading you to crash into the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you\u2019re stranded in a surreal world where the laws of nature seem broken. Objects float in mid-air. Portals appear and vanish without warning, something is clearly very wrong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is this place?<br>What caused the signals?<br>Why is reality falling apart and how do you get out? <br>Is it all real or are you just losing your mind? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/c0283b49de507c8b765970dfdd29e459.poster.avif?t=1749787523\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/c0283b49de507c8b765970dfdd29e459.webm?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758420/extras/c0283b49de507c8b765970dfdd29e459.mp4?t=1749787523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Astro Out is a challenging platformer where you\u2019ll need skill and determination, so be careful, one wrong jump can cost you a lot. After crash-landing on a mysterious and distorted planet, you'll need to find a way out while uncovering the cause behind its strange events.",
